SUMMARY:Labour Organizing: Beginner Union Salt Training - by Workers
  Alliance GTA
LOCATION:First Student Centre room 430\, York University Keele
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.zeffy.com/en-CA/ticketing/labour-organizing-beginner-union-sa
 lt-training\n\nHosted by Workers Alliance GTA
  (https://www.instagram.com/workersalliancegta/)\n\nThis workshop will
  introduce the strategy and history of salting\, while focusing on the
  practical work of building trust\, identifying shared grievances\, having
  organizing conversations\, and mobilizing towards collective action.
  We’ll also consider the risks and responsibilities involved in
  organizing at work\, and how individual workplace struggles can become
  part of a broader labour movement.
END:VEVENT
